// Title: Suspicious Remote Logon with Explicit Credentials
// ID: 941e5c45-cda7-4864-8cea-bbb7458d194a
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: oscd.community, Teymur Kheirkhabarov @HeirhabarovT, Zach Stanford @svch0st, Tim Shelton
// Date: 2020-10-05
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.initial-access, attack.stealth, attack.t1078, attack.lateral-movement
// Description: Detects suspicious processes logging on with explicit credentials
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where ((winlog.event_id == 4648 and (ProcessName endswith "\\cmd.exe" or ProcessName endswith "\\powershell.exe" or ProcessName endswith "\\pwsh.exe" or ProcessName endswith "\\winrs.exe" or ProcessName endswith "\\wmic.exe" or ProcessName endswith "\\net.exe" or ProcessName endswith "\\net1.exe" or ProcessName endswith "\\reg.exe")) and not (((TargetServerName == "localhost") or (SubjectUserName endswith "$" and TargetUserName endswith "$"))))
